		(property "Status" "12 V delegated design: 22 uF 25 V X5R 1206 replacement. Manufacturer typical bias curve gives 6.62332 uF at 12.6 V; 0.8 tolerance and 0.85 temperature screening factors give 4.5038576 uF before aging. Local placement and routing implemented. Typical curves do not guarantee production minimum; cable/source, thermal and full power delivery remain unqualified."
